  "text_md": "![](<832827d9b35b4e6b33c9b9265db0ca1a762283bbd0d6effd84af7f78fc801c7f_images/imageFile4.png>)\nThe contracting authority orders services by sending the contractor a specific contract by e-mail.\n5\nEC - FWC services Dec 2018\n![](<832827d9b35b4e6b33c9b9265db0ca1a762283bbd0d6effd84af7f78fc801c7f_images/imageFile1.png>)\nReimbursement of expenses is not applicable to this FWC.\nI.6.1. Pre-financing\nContract no: [complete]\nPrice revision is determined by the formula set out in Article II.20 and using the trend in the harmonised indices of consumer prices (HICP) MUICP1 published at: https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/web/hicp/data/database under HICP (2015 = 100) - monthly data (index) (prc_hicp_midx).]\n## I.4.3. Implementation of single FWC\nThe maximum amount covering all purchases under this FWC , including all renewals] is EUR [amount in figures and in words]. However, this does not bind the contracting authority to purchase for the maximum amount.\n1 Euro area (19 countries)’: for contracts expressed in euro (as a general rule);\n## I.5.1. Maximum amount of the FWC and maximum prices\n![](<832827d9b35b4e6b33c9b9265db0ca1a762283bbd0d6effd84af7f78fc801c7f_images/imageFile6.png>)\n## I.4.2. Period of provision of the services\n![](<832827d9b35b4e6b33c9b9265db0ca1a762283bbd0d6effd84af7f78fc801c7f_images/imageFile8.png>)",
