        "x1": 0.7987784799726556,
        "y1": 0.40148198305158755
      },
      "text": "If the contractor repeatedly refuses to sign the specific contracts or repeatedly fails to send them back on time, the contractor may be considered in breach of its obligations under this FWC as set out in Article II.18.1 (c).",
